            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Vincent van Gogh</strong><br>\nVincent van Gogh was born on March 30, 1853, in Zundert, Netherlands. He was the eldest son of a Protestant minister and a mother who was an artist at heart, fond of nature and drawing. As a child, Vincent was serious, silent, and thoughtful. Before becoming a painter, he tried various careers, including working in a bookstore, teaching, and even preaching, but he was not satisfied with these jobs. His early life was marked by a sense of displacement, a search for belonging, and a deep love for his family.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Start as an Artist</strong><br>\nVincent van Gogh began his art career later than most artists. At the age of 27, he decided to devote his life to art, a decision influenced by his brother Theo, who worked in the art trade and supported Vincent financially and emotionally. His early works were dark and somber, primarily depicting peasant life. These initial pieces did not resemble the bright, vibrant paintings he became famous for later in his life.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Evolution of Painting Style</strong><br>\nOver time, Vincent's painting style evolved significantly. After moving to Paris in 1886, he discovered impressionism and Japanese prints, which greatly influenced his work. He began using lighter colors, experimenting with his brushwork, and developing his signature style, which involved painting with bold, dramatic brush strokes. This period marked a turning point in Vincent's artistic vision and output.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
